// Canonical CTK test: approve_step
// Tests a person's approval on a step (approve, on_declined): the person is asked once about the exact call, a no is not a failure, the tool
// does not run and the script's on_declined block does. mocks/approve_step.json defines the tool's answer and the person's.

workflow main(text) {
    use Notify(text = text) approve -> receipt on_declined {
        note "declined"
    }
    note "after"
}
